    <strong>$3/month</strong>, with a 7-day trial; it needs Apple silicon and macOS 26 or later. Want free and open source? Start with
    Boring Notch. Want maximum media polish? Look at Alcove. Prices below come from each vendor’s site at the time of
    writing; we disclose that NotchOS is our product.
  </p>

